  "description": "After the Twins offered Boba Fett a rancor as a present to make themselves square, Boba Fett decides he wants to learn to ride it. That skill paid off when chaos broke loose on the streets of Mos Espa, and the Pyke Syndicate attacked. But with the notorious bounty hunter Cad Bane on the scene, Boba Fett had to take even more drastic steps to get control of the situation. This showdown between the two bounty hunters in the galaxy was a long time in the making, as Cad Bane and Boba Fett had a long history, going back to the Clone Wars."
